## 📁 Repository Structure

```
onethought-infra/
├── terraform/                 # AWS Infrastructure as Code
│   ├── main.tf               # Main Terraform config
│   ├── variables.tf          # Variable definitions
│   ├── environments/
│   │   ├── stage.tfvars      # Stage environment variables
│   │   └── prod.tfvars       # Prod environment variables
│   └── modules/              # Reusable Terraform modules
│       ├── vpc/              # VPC, subnets, security groups
│       ├── eks/              # EKS cluster
│       ├── ecr/              # Container registry
│       ├── alb-controller/   # AWS Load Balancer Controller
│       ├── waf/              # Web Application Firewall
│       ├── kms/              # Key Management Service
│       └── secrets/          # AWS Secrets Manager
│
├── helm/
│   └── onethought/           # Main Helm chart
│       ├── Chart.yaml
│       ├── values.yaml       # Default values
│       ├── values.stage.yaml # Stage overrides (Supabase Stage)
│       ├── values.prod.yaml  # Prod overrides (Supabase Prod)
│       └── templates/        # Kubernetes manifests
│
├── k8s/
│   └── monitoring/           # Monitoring stack configs
│       ├── grafana-dashboard-onethought.yaml
│       └── cluster-secret-store.yaml
│
├── scripts/                  # Helper scripts
│   ├── deploy-stage.sh       # Deploy to stage
│   ├── deploy-prod.sh        # Deploy to production
│   ├── install-monitoring.sh # Setup Grafana/Loki/Prometheus
│   └── kubectl-port-forward-*.sh
│
├── secrets.stage.yaml.example  # Template for stage secrets
├── secrets.prod.yaml.example   # Template for prod secrets
└── docs/                       # Documentation
```

